## Media assets

The MIT grant above covers the **source code** of this project only — the files
under `lib/` and `tools/`, plus the package metadata.

It does **not** cover the media files under `assets/` (animation frames and
encoded animations, artwork, and the placeholder audio clips). Those files are
distributed so that this plugin can be used with them; they are not licensed
under the MIT grant and no rights in them are granted by it.

If you want to reuse the artwork or audio outside of this plugin, ask first.
See [THIRD_PARTY_ASSETS.md](THIRD_PARTY_ASSETS.md) for the provenance of each
media file and for the constraints that apply to audio you supply yourself.
